       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    NWC490.
       AUTHOR.        P. GONZALES.
       INSTALLATION.  NORTHWIND TRADERS - DALLAS DIVISION.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  10/09/97.
      *****************************************************************
      *  PRODUCT SELECT WINDOW (F4 PROMPT)
      *
      *  PARAMETER: RETURNS THE SELECTED PRODUCT (UNCHANGED ON F12)
      *  SAME CODE AS NWC190
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DSPFILE ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-NWC490D-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RELATIVE KEY IS WS-RRN
               FILE STATUS IS WS-DSP-STAT.
           SELECT PRDMSTL1 ASSIGN TO DATABASE-PRDMSTL1
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS PL-KEY
               WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WS-PRDMSTL1-STAT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DSPFILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DSP-REC                     PIC X(2000).
       FD  PRDMSTL1
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY PRDL1CP.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  WS-RRN                      PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-DSP-STAT                 PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-PRDMSTL1-STAT            PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-SAVE-POS                 PIC X(20) VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-NUM-KEY                  PIC 9(5)  VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-IND-AREA.
           05  WS-IND      PIC 1 OCCURS 99 TIMES INDICATOR 1.
       01  W1SFL-I-AREA.
           COPY DDS-W1SFL-I OF NWC490D.
       01  W1SFL-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-W1SFL-O OF NWC490D.
       01  W1CTL-I-AREA.
           COPY DDS-W1CTL-I OF NWC490D.
       01  W1CTL-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-W1CTL-O OF NWC490D.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-KEY                      PIC S9(5) COMP-3.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-KEY.
       0000-MAINLINE.
           OPEN I-O DSPFILE.
           OPEN INPUT PRDMSTL1.
           MOVE ALL "0" TO WS-IND-AREA.
           INITIALIZE W1CTL-I-AREA W1CTL-O-AREA.
           PERFORM 1000-LOAD THRU 1000-EXIT.
       0100-SHOW.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM W1CTL-O-AREA FORMAT IS "W1CTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           READ DSPFILE INTO W1CTL-I-AREA FORMAT IS "W1CTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           IF WS-IND(12) = B"1" GO TO 9000-END.
           IF W1POS OF W1CTL-I NOT = WS-SAVE-POS
               PERFORM 1000-LOAD THRU 1000-EXIT
               GO TO 0100-SHOW.
       0200-PICK.
           READ SUBFILE DSPFILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
               INTO W1SFL-I-AREA FORMAT IS "W1SFL"
               AT END GO TO 0100-SHOW.
           IF W1OPT OF W1SFL-I = "1"
               MOVE H1KEY OF W1SFL-I TO WS-NUM-KEY
               MOVE WS-NUM-KEY TO LK-KEY
               GO TO 9000-END.
           GO TO 0200-PICK.
       9000-END.
           CLOSE DSPFILE PRDMSTL1.
           GOBACK.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-LOAD.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(33).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(31).
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM W1CTL-O-AREA FORMAT IS "W1CTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(33).
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-RRN.
           MOVE W1POS OF W1CTL-I TO WS-SAVE-POS W1POS OF W1CTL-O.
           MOVE SPACES TO PL-KEY.
           MOVE WS-SAVE-POS TO PL-NAME.
           START PRDMSTL1 KEY IS NOT LESS THAN PL-KEY
               INVALID KEY GO TO 1000-DONE.
       1000-READ.
           READ PRDMSTL1 NEXT RECORD AT END GO TO 1000-DONE.
           ADD 1 TO WS-RRN.
           MOVE SPACE TO W1OPT OF W1SFL-O.
           MOVE PL-PRD-NO TO W1KEY OF W1SFL-O.
           MOVE PL-PRD-NO TO H1KEY OF W1SFL-O.
           MOVE PL-NAME TO W1NAME OF W1SFL-O.
           WRITE SUBFILE DSP-REC FROM W1SFL-O-AREA FORMAT IS "W1SFL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           IF WS-RRN < 300 GO TO 1000-READ.
       1000-DONE.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(32).
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(34).
           IF WS-RRN > ZERO MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(31).
       1000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
